DELL	MUMBAI	45000	557
DELL	CHENNAI	31000	490
HP	BANGALORE	43000	596
HP	DELHI	33000	136
HP	BHUBANESWAR	48000	691
HP	MUMBAI	39000	309
HP	CHENNAI	48000	312
